{
 "_about": [
  "The tables of SCOPE 'Data model' (DBU-01). tools/setup-backend.mjs applies `tables` through POST /admin/schema/apply; a NodeGX backend keeps its schema in its data directory, not in the project, so this file is the source of truth.",
  "Every relation is a plain String holding the other row's objectId (`learner` is a _User objectId). Not a Pointer: a cloud function cannot filter on one (backend doctrine rule 4).",
  "Domain times (startsAt, dueAt, reviewedAt, readAt…) are ISO-8601 strings. A row's own time (when a message was sent, when a version was handed in) is the backend's createdAt.",
  "`enums` is the one owner of every fixed value: check-seed validates against it and the functions copy it. The backend does not enforce it.",
  "_User is not declared: it is built in and takes the extra fields (name, organisation, jobTitle, timezone, lastSeenAt) without a schema. Who is the coach is the `staff` role, never a field.",
  "Doorbell is the one collection a client may read (find, ACL-filtered): docs/DECISIONS.md 2026-11-07 'The doorbell'.",
  "LibraryItem (DBU-03): handInChecklist is [{text, required}] (an older plain string reads as required); resources are [{label, url}] or [{label, file, fileName}] where file is a stored name the coach uploaded privately; archived hides an item from the plan pickers. A homework Step copies these fields in the same shapes.",
  "PlanTemplate (DBU-04): items are [{kind, title, durationMin (live), libraryItem (homework), dayOffset}], a plan's shape and never a learner's data; archived hides a template from the plan builder and Add learner.",
  "Submission (DBU-06, several files 2026-11-12): a file version's files are [{file, fileName}], 1 to 5 of them, file being the stored name of the learner's private upload; Richard reviews the version as one.",
  "Message mail (DBU-07): a new message is saved with `mailPending: true`; shared/Message mail sends it (at once, or held up to 5 minutes and grouped with the next ones), then sets `mailPending: false` and `mailedAt`. Seeded messages are already mailed.",
  "Setting (DBU-07): one row per key, written only by staff functions. `coachEmail` is where learner messages are mailed (default coach@example.com when there is no row: set the real one in Settings). `coachName` is the name learners see (DBU-11), read by the public coachName function.",
  "Inbox (DBU-08): a question ends when the coach replies, or marks the learner's newest message `settledAt` (\"No reply needed\"); reading it does not. QuietFlag is one learner gone quiet, raised, updated and closed only by the daily `morningRound`: `reasons` are {kind: 'inactive', lastActiveAt} and {kind: 'overdue', stepId, title, dueAt}; `snoozedUntil` hides it (Snooze a week, or a nudge sent, `nudgedAt`); `closedAt` set means over. Setting `digestSentAt` is when the last morning digest went."
 ],
 "enums": {
